### Users api routes


### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/users/3 HTTP/1.1


### Create new user
POST http://localhost:8000/users/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "gundam",
  "email": "gundam@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### User login
POST http://localhost:8000/users/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "gundam",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8000/users/get_all_users HTTP/1.1


### Create role
POST http://localhost:8000/users/create_role HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin",
  "role_number": 0
}